Network use — AGPL section 13
-----------------------------

If you run this software, modified or not, so that users interact with it
remotely over a network, section 13 obliges you to offer those users access to
the corresponding source. The complete source of this fork, including
`calc-api/`, is available at:

    https://github.com/suryansh2846code/vedic-calc

Applications served by a deployment of `calc-api/` link to this repository from
their user-facing interface in order to satisfy that obligation.
